{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ForwardChanges","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this system to let code outside the schedule follow a component, such as a view that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redraws a health bar when the health changes. Each element of the stream is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" of the entity and its component:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let (changes, continuation) = AsyncStream.makeStream(of: QueryRow<Health>.self)","var world = World()","let knight = world.spawn(Health(current: 30))","world.spawn(Health(current: 50))","","let frame = Schedule { ForwardChanges(to: continuation) }","frame.run(on: &world)","world[Health.self, of: knight].current = 25","frame.run(on: &world)","continuation.finish()","","var healths: [Int] = []","for await row in changes {","    healths.append(row.components.current)","}","print(healths)","\/\/ Prints \"[30, 50, 25]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The first run yields every ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"text":"; each later run yields those added or changed since the run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"befo